# Hosts that block automated requests and would otherwise open a weekly
# "Link check failures" issue for links that are fine in a real browser.
# Remove an entry if you want that link genuinely verified.

# Social platforms serve a login wall / 403 to non-browser clients
https://x\.com/.*
https://www\.instagram\.com/.*
https://www\.tiktok\.com/.*

# Rejects HEAD and rate-limits datacenter IPs
https://itunes\.apple\.com/.*
